# tmpfiles.d entry for the ClamAV service runtime dir. Both service
# units run unprivileged (User=clamav), so neither can create its own
# runtime dir under /var/run (RuntimeDirectory= only covers /run):
# tmpfiles.d owns creation with the service identity, shipped by the
# base clamav package that also owns the identity and the dir stanza.
# /var/run is persistent by design, never wiped at boot.
d /var/run/clamav 0750 clamav clamav -
